#
#   formatting_context_box_types - Layout::FormattingContext: which context a box creates
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FormattingContext.cpp (lines 44-196) and FormattingContext.h's
#       type_name (lines 78-101): creates_block_formatting_context,
#       formatting_context_type_created_by_box and type_name. Taken ahead of region r44 by
#       region r43, because every dump of a layout tree names the formatting context each box
#       creates ("[BFC]"); their stubs are gone from stub_r44_layout_formatting. Region r44
#       ports the rest of FormattingContext.cpp around them.
